program ProtectedDissent
purpose "Preserve disagreement while finding a bounded route."
claim "A resolution may proceed without pretending consensus."
risk medium
path O -> E -> W -> U -> I -> G -> V -> F -> Y
evidence record "Attributed positions."
unknown final_consensus protected required_for=full_merge
invariant dissent "No position may disappear without resolution."
authority facilitator scope=bounded_resolution "Facilitator may propose but not erase positions."
affected advocate
affected critic
dissent advocate "Proceed through a bounded pilot."
dissent critic "Do not proceed while critical unknowns remain."
recovery reopen "Reopen the decision when new evidence appears."
effect MayAffect<advocate,critic>
yield "Bounded resolution with preserved dissent."
